#: ../../dev/setup.md:1
msgid "Development Setup"
msgstr "開発環境のセットアップ"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:3
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "Requirement"
msgstr "要件"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "Version"
msgstr "バージョン"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "JDK"
msgstr "JDK"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "21 or later"
msgstr "21 以降"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "IntelliJ IDEA"
msgstr "IntelliJ IDEA"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "2025.3+ (Ultimate or Community)"
msgstr "2025.3+ (Ultimate または Community)"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "Git"
msgstr "Git"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "Any recent version"
msgstr "最新バージョン"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "Node.js"
msgstr "Node.js"

#: ../../dev/setup.md
msgid "For testing LSP features"
msgstr "LSP 機能のテスト用"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:12
msgid "Clone the Repository"
msgstr "リポジトリのクローン"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:19
msgid "Open in IntelliJ IDEA"
msgstr "IntelliJ IDEA で開く"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:21
msgid "Open IntelliJ IDEA"
msgstr "IntelliJ IDEA を開きます"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:22
msgid "**File** → **Open** → Select the cloned repository"
msgstr "**File** → **Open** → クローンしたリポジトリを選択"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:23
msgid "IntelliJ will detect the Gradle project and import it automatically"
msgstr "IntelliJ が Gradle プロジェクトを検出し、自動的にインポートします"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:24
msgid "Wait for the Gradle sync to complete (this downloads dependencies)"
msgstr "Gradle の同期が完了するまで待ちます（依存関係がダウンロードされます）"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:26
msgid "Verify the Setup"
msgstr "セットアップの確認"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:28
msgid "Run the build to ensure everything is configured correctly:"
msgstr "ビルドを実行して、すべてが正しく設定されていることを確認します:"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:34
msgid "This will:"
msgstr "これにより以下が実行されます:"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:35
msgid "Generate the JFlex lexer (`RescriptFlexLexer.java`) from `Rescript.flex`"
msgstr "`Rescript.flex` から JFlex レクサー (`RescriptFlexLexer.java`) を生成"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:36
msgid "Compile all Kotlin source code"
msgstr "すべての Kotlin ソースコードをコンパイル"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:37
msgid "Run ktlint checks"
msgstr "ktlint チェックを実行"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:38
msgid "Package the plugin"
msgstr "プラグインをパッケージング"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:40
msgid "Run a Development IDE Instance"
msgstr "開発用 IDE インスタンスの起動"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:46
msgid ""
"This launches a fresh IntelliJ IDEA instance with the plugin loaded. You "
"can open a ReScript project in this instance to test your changes."
msgstr ""
"プラグインが読み込まれた新しい IntelliJ IDEA インスタンスが起動します。"
"このインスタンスで ReScript プロジェクトを開いて変更をテストできます。"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:48
msgid "Project JDK Configuration"
msgstr "プロジェクト JDK の設定"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:50
msgid "If IntelliJ doesn't automatically detect your JDK:"
msgstr "IntelliJ が JDK を自動検出しない場合:"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:52
msgid "**File** → **Project Structure** → **Project**"
msgstr "**File** → **Project Structure** → **Project**"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:53
msgid "Set **SDK** to JDK 21+"
msgstr "**SDK** を JDK 21+ に設定"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:54
msgid "Set **Language level** to 21"
msgstr "**Language level** を 21 に設定"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:56
msgid "Recommended IDE Plugins"
msgstr "推奨 IDE プラグイン"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:58
msgid ""
"For development, consider installing these plugins in your development "
"IDE:"
msgstr ""
"開発にあたって、開発用 IDE に以下のプラグインのインストールを検討してください:"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:60
msgid "**Kotlin** — Should be bundled"
msgstr "**Kotlin** — バンドル済みのはずです"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:61
msgid "**Gradle** — Should be bundled"
msgstr "**Gradle** — バンドル済みのはずです"

#: ../../dev/setup.md:62
msgid "**Grammar-Kit** — Helpful for working with JFlex/BNF grammars"
msgstr "**Grammar-Kit** — JFlex/BNF 文法の作業に役立ちます"

